<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 to $1.00 Lower. Demand was light with a moderate movement. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  50.00-51.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  44.00-50.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  39.00-44.00</p>
<p>Sows - weak/off $1.50. Top $49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-45.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 46.00-49.50</p>
</text>
